    PARTY `s 241.2 a medical practitioner or nurse practitioner` DOES `s 241.2(3.1) meet the safeguards of paragraphs (a) to (k) before providing medical assistance in dying` AT 1
-- (3.2) a practitioner may administer a substance without meeting (3)(h) if (a)(i) to (iv), (b) the person has lost capacity, (c) the person does not demonstrate refusal or resistance, and (d) the substance is administered in accordance with the arrangement
--                                                                                                (a)(i) (ii)  (iii) (iv)  (b)   (c)makes involuntary (d)
#ASSERT `s 241.2(3.2) the practitioner may administer a substance without meeting the requirement of paragraph (3)(h)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
