-- (3.3) "involuntary words, sounds or gestures made in response to contact do not constitute a demonstration of refusal or resistance"
#ASSERT `s 241.2(3.3) the words, sounds or gestures constitute a demonstration of refusal or resistance` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 241.2(3.3) the words, sounds or gestures constitute a demonstration of refusal or resistance` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3.4) "Once a person demonstrates ... refusal ... or resistance, ... medical assistance in dying can no longer be provided to them on the basis of the consent given ... under subparagraph (3.2)(a)(iv)"
