-- (6) the two practitioners are independent if they (a) are not a mentor ..., (b) do not know or believe ... a beneficiary ..., and (c) do not know or believe that they are connected ...
#ASSERT `s 241.2(6) the two practitioners are independent` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 241.2(6) the two practitioners are independent` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
