-- (7) "Medical assistance in dying must be provided with reasonable knowledge, care and skill and in accordance with any applicable provincial laws, rules or standards"
#ASSERT `s 241.2(7) medical assistance in dying has been provided as this subsection requires` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 241.2(7) medical assistance in dying has been provided as this subsection requires` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 241.2(7) medical assistance in dying has been provided as this subsection requires` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#TRACE `s 241.2(7) the duty to provide medical assistance in dying with reasonable knowledge, care and skill` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 241.2 a medical practitioner or nurse practitioner` DOES `s 241.2(7) provide medical assistance in dying with reasonable knowledge, care and skill and in accordance with applicable provincial laws, rules or standards` AT 1
-- (8) the practitioner who prescribes or obtains a substance "must, before any pharmacist dispenses the substance, inform the pharmacist"
#ASSERT `s 241.2(8) the practitioner has informed the pharmacist` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 241.2(8) the practitioner has informed the pharmacist` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 241.2(8) the practitioner has informed the pharmacist` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#TRACE `s 241.2(8) the duty to inform the pharmacist` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 241.2 a medical practitioner or nurse practitioner` DOES `s 241.2(8) inform the pharmacist, before any pharmacist dispenses the substance, that the substance is intended for medical assistance in dying` AT 1
