#ASSERT `s 241.2(9) section 241.2 compels the individual to provide or assist in providing medical assistance in dying` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 241.2(9) section 241.2 compels the individual to provide or assist in providing medical assistance in dying` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Sections 241.3, 241.31 and 241.4`

-- 241.3 "A medical practitioner or nurse practitioner who, in providing medical assistance in dying, knowingly fails to comply, subject to subsection 241.2(3.2), with all of the requirements set out in paragraphs 241.2(3)(b) to (h) or paragraphs 241.2(3.1)(b) to (k), as the case may be, and with subsection 241.2(8) is guilty of (a) an indictable offence ... five years; or (b) summary conviction"
--                                                                                      knowingly foreseeable (3)(b)-(h)     (3.1)(b)-(k)    (8)
#ASSERT `s 241.3 the practitioner commits the offence of failing to comply with the safeguards` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
