-- 241.31(1) "Unless they are exempted under regulations made under subsection (3), a medical practitioner or nurse practitioner who carries out an assessment ... or who receives a written request ... must ... provide the information required by those regulations"
#ASSERT `s 241.31(1) the practitioner must provide the information required by the regulations` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 241.31(1) the practitioner must provide the information required by the regulations` (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 241.31(1) the practitioner must provide the information required by the regulations` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 241.31(1) the practitioner must provide the information required by the regulations` (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
