-- 241.31(4) "A medical practitioner or nurse practitioner who knowingly fails to comply with subsection (1), a person ... who knowingly fails to comply with subsection (1.1) or a pharmacist or pharmacy technician who knowingly fails to comply with subsection (2), (a) ... two years; or (b) summary conviction"
#ASSERT `s 241.31(4) the person commits the offence` `s 241.31(4) a medical practitioner or nurse practitioner who fails to comply with subsection (1)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 241.31(4) the person commits the offence` `s 241.31(4) a person having the responsibility to carry out preliminary assessments who fails to comply with subsection (1.1)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 241.31(4) the person commits the offence` `s 241.31(4) a pharmacist or pharmacy technician who fails to comply with subsection (2)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 241.31(4) the person commits the offence` `s 241.31(4) a pharmacist or pharmacy technician who fails to comply with subsection (2)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
